&lt;hr class="page-divider">
&lt;p class="story-status">Status: Designed during the sabbatical - generalized from the documentation health reporting I ran at Zeta&lt;/p>
&lt;p>I designed this measurement framework to report on documentation impact to leadership, not just track it internally.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>60-Second Summary&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="60-second-summary">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#60-second-summary" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Documentation should not be measured by volume. It should be measured by impact.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>This model defines how documentation effectiveness can be evaluated using user behavior, support trends, and product adoption signals.&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2>Context&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="context">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#context" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Documentation teams often measure output:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>number of documents created&lt;/li>
&lt;li>pages updated&lt;/li>
&lt;li>release notes published&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>These metrics do not reflect whether documentation actually helps users.&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2>Problem&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="problem">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#problem" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;div align="center">
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code">
&lt;div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">More Content
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ↓
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">No Usage Insight
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ↓
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Unclear Value
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ↓
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Low Adoption
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> ↓
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Support Dependency&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0">
