&lt;hr>
&lt;h2>Key Insight&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="key-insight">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#key-insight" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>Documentation is successful only when users do not need support.&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>The goal is not more content. The goal is fewer unanswered questions.&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
&lt;h2>Applied Experience&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="applied-experience">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#applied-experience" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>This model generalizes real experience at Zeta - tracking documentation health by triaging 200+ support tickets, maintaining weekly documentation health reports for stakeholders, and contributing to a 50% improvement in release readiness - aligning documentation with product outcomes.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>It demonstrates how documentation can be measured as part of product performance, not just content output.&lt;/p>
